<title>USA: Apple Orthodontix IPO lowers price range.</title>
<headline>Apple Orthodontix IPO lowers price range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The estimated price range for the planned initial public offering in Apple Orthodontix Inc was reduced to $8 to $9 from $10 to $12 originally, lead underwriter Bear Stearns said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The planned initial public offering retained its proposed number of shares at 2.35 million shares. Apple Orthodontix, a company in the orthodontix practice, is expected to trade on Friday under the proposed symbol &quot;AO&quot; on the American Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
